  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0: phnt sync from fc2518bae7\n\nSync Veil headers to phnt commit fc2518bae7 (baseline 4caaec5412).\n\n- 13 headers updated, +680/-62 lines\n- New enums: LDR_RESOURCE_QUERY_FLAGS, MTA_HOST_USAGE_FLAGS\n- New structs: SYSTEM_POWER_POLICY_ACDC, MTA_USAGE_GLOBALS, CSR_SUBSYSTEM_DATA_HEADER\n- New functions: RXact subsystem (RtlAbortRXact, RtlAddActionToRXact, etc.), RtlGetPerSubsystemServerData\n- RTL_BITMAP inline control: VEIL_INLINE_RTL_BITMAP (opt-in, was VEIL_NO_INLINE_RTL_BITMAP opt-out)\n- Fixes: LdrGetDllFullName return type, PEB TppWorkerpListLock type, MACRO conversions\n- All targets pass: 0 errors, 0 warnings",
